<figure id="A1.T3" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 3. </span>The evaluation results of LLMs. The best performance within the same column is highlighted in <span id="A1.T3.6" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">bold italics</span>, and the best performance within the same row is marked in <span id="A1.T3.7" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic" style="--ltx-fg-color:#0F75FF;">blue</span>, <span id="A1.T3.8" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic" style="--ltx-fg-color:#009900;">green</span>, and <span id="A1.T3.9" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FF0080;">red</span> for Acc, Respect, and F1, respectively. The subscripts in the column of Corr represent the p-value of the Spearman correlation coefficient. * denotes the significance (p&lt;0.05).</figcaption>
<table id="A1.T3.10" class="ltx_tabular ltx_centering ltx_guessed_headers ltx_align_middle">
<thead class="ltx_thead">
<tr id="A1.T3.10.1" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="A1.T3.10.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_tt" style="padding-left:4.5pt;padding-right:4.5pt;" rowspan="2"><span id="A1.T3.10.1.1.1" class="ltx_text">Countries</span></th>
<th id="A1.T3.10.1.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_tt" style="padding-left:4.5pt;padding-right:4.5pt;" colspan="4">Qwen2.5-7B</th>
<th id="A1.T3.10.1.3" class="ltx_td ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_tt" style="padding-left:4.5pt;padding-right:4.5pt;"></th>
<th id="A1.T3.10.1.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_tt" style="padding-left:4.5pt;padding-right:4.5pt;" colspan="4">Qwen2.5-14B</th>
<th id="A1.T3.10.1.5" class="ltx_td ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_tt" style="padding-left:4.5pt;padding-right:4.5pt;"></th>
